sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as RHOAI Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ConfigMap as odh-feastoperator-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant Controller as FeastOperator Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>/manifests/
    participant AppNS as Applications Namespace
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitor

    Note over Platform,AppNS: Reconciliation Loop

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create FeastOperator CR<br/>(Cluster-scoped)
    Platform->>K8sAPI: Update odh-feastoperator-config<br/>(platformVersion)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: FeastOperator CR
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: ConfigMap change

    Controller->>ConfigMap: Read platformVersion
    ConfigMap-->>Controller: platformVersion value

    alt Platform version advanced
        Controller->>Controller: Run version-gated<br/>migration logic
    end

    Controller->>Kustomize: Render manifests<br/>with kustomized params
    Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered K8s resources

    loop Deploy pipeline: initialize → upgrade → render → deploy → gc
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Jobs/CronJobs
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PDBs, HPAs
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Garbage-collect stale resources
    end

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator status<br/>(platformVersion, conditions)

    Note over Controller,Prometheus: Metrics Collection

    Controller->>Controller: Expose /metrics on :8443<br/>HTTPS + TokenReview auth
    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>via opendatahub-feast-metrics-service
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Controller,AppNS: Cross-Component Watches

    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch: FeatureStore CRs (feast.dev)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch: Kubeflow Notebooks
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch: OpenShift Routes
